<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n83933" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πλόκ-ᾰνον</span></b> , τό, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>plaited work, basket-work,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Ti.</u>
				78c
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>HP</u>
				4.10.4
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.S.
				3.37
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>wicker fan for winnowing,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Ti.</u>
				52e
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Poll.
				1.225
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>plaited rope,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Cyn.</u>
				9.12
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Poll.
				5.33
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b>
			<i>sieve, strainer,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				2.500
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				6.179
			</span></i>:—<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πλόχανον</span> is
				v.l. in both passages of <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
			</span></i> and is cited by <i><span class="en">
				Suid.
			</span></i>: <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πλόκαμον</span> is f.l. in
			<i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Ti.</u>
				78c
			</span></i>, X.l.c., <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
			</span></i> ll.cc.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
